#: ../../modules/view.md:132 59c538d4e503486ba9a2e7d946324ee7
msgid "In Minecraft, predicates can check if a player is looking at an entity. If you only need a simple player-specific check, you should consider using the [looked entity](#looked-entity) functions."
msgstr "在 Minecraft 中，谓词可以检测玩家是否正在注视某个实体。如果只需要简单的玩家特定检查，建议使用 [被注视的实体](#looked-entity) 函数。"

