msgstr "视线是否畅通（as → at）"

#: ../../modules/view.md:213 c8dc2fed6d2741d9b934d545a4898d32
msgid "Determine if an entity, from its current position, can have an unobstructed view to the execution position."
msgstr "验证从实体当前位置到执行位置之间能否被视线穿过。"

