#: ../../modules/view.md:250 6924cbcc7e384d6da526c0eee20be734
msgid "In view \"as to at\""
msgstr "是否位于视野内（as → at）"

#: ../../modules/view.md:254 5ff4c90a779d46bf98e41d88252f3318
msgid "Determine if an entity has a specific position within its field of view, which is represented as a cone originating from the entity's eye."
msgstr "判断某个位置是否在实体的视野范围（从实体眼睛发出的锥体）内。"

#: ../../modules/view.md:257 6bb9a4e58c284a87a47d957201ac7735
msgid "**Execution `as <entities>`**: entities whose field of view is being checked"
msgstr "**执行 `as <entities>`**：正在检查其视野的实体"

#: ../../modules/view.md:259 a68397424db74a65af8e3fd700696490
msgid "**Execution `at <entity>` or `positioned <x> <y> <z>`**: position to check if within the field of view cone"
msgstr "**执行 `at <entity>` 或 `positioned <x> <y> <z>`**：用于判断目标是否位于视野锥内的位置。"

#: ../../modules/view.md:264 19df287d50eb4d629faef059ae07d7d8
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`number` **angle**: angle of the field of view cone, based on world coordinates (not the fov option)"
msgstr "{nbt}`number` **angle**：表示视野的角度。这是圆锥开口的角度，基于世界坐标计算，而非 `fov` 选项。"

#: ../../modules/view.md:271 6c9220d93ae944a1bc9495cefee69bc8
msgid "*Example: check whether the position 0 5 0 is in your field of view*"
msgstr "*示例：检查坐标 0 5 0 是否在你的视野内。*"

