#: 8db79e185cb74e37b093e981c6828037 b9042e589bb040d3a4ff53573a001dd8
msgid "**Tag `bs.view.is_lookable`**: tag that must be added to entities that can be looked at"
msgstr "**标签 `bs.view.is_lookable`**：必须添加到可被注视的实体上的标签。"

#: ../../modules/view.md:304 83465acc4ab34b348f2432e1ba7c0eb4
msgid "*Example: make the armor stand the player is looking at glow*"
msgstr "*示例：让玩家正注视的盔甲架发光。*"

#: ../../modules/view.md:317 c435ad0948354adaa68833be1e6b0602
msgid "Run a command at the entity a player is looking at."
