#: ../../modules/view.md:341 651efee831b34a83a63f235b14168b92
msgid "Technical limitations"
msgstr "技术限制"

#: ../../modules/view.md:344 5e4491465490451381c3a9689216fb96
msgid "As this function relies on a player-specific predicate, it is exclusively designed for players. Additionally, to optimize performance, only a maximum of 255 entities are allowed to have the `bs.view.is_lookable` tag simultaneously."
msgstr "由于此函数依赖于特定于玩家的谓词，它专门为玩家设计。此外，为了优化性能，同时只允许最多255个实体拥有 `bs.view.is_lookable` 标签。"

